# Build-time frontend assets (downloaded by fetch-assets)
public/assets/ketcher/
public/assets/vendor/

# `public/assets/lotus-explore.css` is deliberately NOT ignored. `dx` compiles it
# from `tailwind/styles.css`, but `asset!` reads it at compile time, so a
# checkout without it cannot build the app at all. Committing it is the
# Dioxus-with-Tailwind convention, and `tests/design_tokens.rs` fails if the
# committed sheet drifts from the theme in `tailwind/styles.css`.

# Build artifacts
target/

# Cargo
Cargo.lock
